# Phase 0 minimal image — package/component manifest
# Exit-criteria image per phase-0-foundation/README.md: boots to text
# console with verified boot + OTA update working. Nothing more.

kernel: continuum-kernel (LTS + Phase 0 patch series)
init: systemd (provisional per ADR 0002) — minimal target, no GUI
filesystem: ext4 read-only root (ADR 0003)
boot-chain: continuum-secure-boot, continuum-dm-verity-tools
update-client: continuum-ab-updated
recovery: continuum-recovery-env (see cross-cutting/recovery-mode/)
diagnostics: continuum-telemetry-agent (minimal: boot success/failure beacon only,
             per cross-cutting/telemetry-privacy/ — full telemetry schema is a later addition)
console: getty on serial + local tty, no display server
